message: "If you refer to this tracker, please cite it as below and give the date you read it; the pages change as fixes are reviewed and released."
title: "htn-research: reliability tracker for the Hoosat node (HTND) and mining bridge"
abstract: "A continuously updated record of what has been fixed, what is under review and how it is tested in the Hoosat full node (HTND) and the htn-stratum-bridge, with findings, measurements and links to every upstream change. Started in October 2026 as a reliability review of HTND 2.18.1 and htn-stratum-bridge v1.8.0."
type: dataset
